      "cr": 0,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Shaggy.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 0 as a student. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Classroom 2-B / The One Nobody Had Briefed</strong> — Trinity General School, Classroom 2-B</p><p>Status: Active — student, Classroom 2-B; disclosed that he has attended Trinity for a long time without ever having SCHALE explained to him</p><p>Shaggy slouches, crouches behind his desk to avoid roll call, bounces one leg hard enough to vibrate the furniture, and contributes to the session mainly by admitting he does not understand things. That admission is the most valuable thing anyone says: he has been at Trinity for years and nobody ever explained SCHALE to him, which reframes the entire disclosure from a briefing into an indictment.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Fists</strong> — “Classroom 2-B / The One Nobody Had Briefed”</li><li><strong>Hidden in Plain Sight</strong> — “A hand rose slowly from behind a desk near the window, where he had been crouched low trying to make himself invisible, and he stood up with his characteristic slouch, green shirt off one shoulder.”</li><li><strong>Silver Tongue</strong> — “He described himself and Scooby as diplomatic solution kind of guys.”</li><li><strong>Keen Records</strong> — “He described himself and Scooby as diplomatic solution kind of guys.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/shaggy</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/shaggy</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
